## Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{{#if useDocker}}
make infra-up          # start docker services
{{/if}}
go mod tidy
{{#if ormGorm}}
# GORM auto-migration runs on startup — no manual migration needed
{{/if}}
{{#if ormNone}}
go run ./cmd            # start the server
{{else}}
make run                # start the server
{{/if}}
```

Or use Air for hot reload:

```bash
go install github.com/air-verse/air@latest
make dev
```

